newmtl metal
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.450000
illum 3
map_Kd C:/metal_BaseColor.png
map_Ns C:/metal_Roughness.png
map_refl C:/metal_Metallic.png
map_d C:/metal_Alpha.png
map_Bump -bm 1.000000 C:/metal_Normal.png

